Package: montyhall
Title: This package plays the game inspired by "Deal or No Deal"
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Jordan",
           family = "Christian",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jordan.christian@asu.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-9389-9790"))
Description: This package is dubbed montyhall from inspiration of the game deal or no deal
 The game begins with 3 doors; 2 of which have a goat and 1 of which has a car. The contestant selects
 a door as does the host. The contestant then chooses to keep or switch their door. Once decided, the game
 is ran and the results are revealed, indicating the results from whether the contestant stayed or switch.
